Package: eve-empire
Version: ${VERSION}
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: ${ARCH}
Installed-Size: ${SIZE}
Depends: ca-certificates
Recommends: systemd
Maintainer: Evgeniy Semenov <eve-empire@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/ShadowPriest/eve-empire
Description: personal cabinet for EVE Online alts via ESI
 Single static binary plus SQLite. Runs as a systemd service under the
 eve-empire user, listens on :8080, keeps its databases in
 /var/lib/eve-empire and reads EVE SSO credentials from
 /etc/eve-empire/eve-empire.env.
